https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T15:29:13Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T15:29:13Z","body":"I gave it more testing, because something wasn't right and the linked issue is actually a regression.\r\nI have a plugin that uses the Create New submenu. It was working correctly at some point, but it seems broken on master. I don't know why, but while the list of paths for popup is correct, the callback always receives empty array.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the aforementioned regression, but there is inconsistency. The popup method receives path to the selected file, while the callback receives a folder. I think this should be made consistent, i.e. the popup method should also receive folder path, not a file. So this line\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/99f5a3d665cfcc517b0b4b55d8668c2116effb69/editor/filesystem_dock.cpp#L3323\r\nshould get a similar tweak to what this PR already does.\r\n\r\nIt _technically_ breaks compatibility, but it's better to be consistent, and base folder path makes more sense for create option.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2913017824/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914707149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106820#issuecomment-2914707149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106820","id":2914707149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tuubN","user":{"login":"OzelotVanilla","id":59910575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTEwNTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59910575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla","html_url":"https://github.com/OzelotVanilla","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T02:34:16Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T02:34:16Z","body":"Just finished the rebase work and pushed.\r\nAnd I remember in the first, I wrongly chose `4.4` branch for testing, then I changed to `master`, found that the path param for the callback function changes.\r\n\r\nIn my own opinion, I also agree that changing the behaviour of passing the param for the callback is better. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914707149/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_v