s>:1:\r\nIn file included from /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX15.4.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/CoreVideo.framework/Headers/CoreVideo.h:29:\r\nIn file included from /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX15.4.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/CoreVideo.framework/Headers/CVPixelBuffer.h:23:\r\n/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX15.4.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/CoreVideo.framework/Headers/CVImageBuffer.h:29:10: fatal error: could not build module 'ApplicationServices'\r\n   29 | #include <ApplicationServices/ApplicationServices.h>\r\n      |  ~~~~~~~~^\r\nWhile building module 'QuartzCore' imported from drivers/metal/metal_objects.h:62:\r\nIn file included from <module-includes>:1:\r\nIn file included from /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX15.4.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/QuartzCore.framework/Headers/QuartzCore.h:20:\r\nIn file included from /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX15.4.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/QuartzCore.framework/Headers/CoreAnimation.h:34:\r\n/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX15.4.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/QuartzCore.framework/Headers/CAOpenGLLayer.h:9:9: fatal error: could not build module 'CoreVideo'\r\n    9 | #import <CoreVideo/CVBase.h>\r\n      |  ~~~~~~~^\r\nIn file included from drivers/metal/rendering_device_driver_metal.mm:51:\r\nIn file included from drivers/metal/rendering_device_driver_metal.h:33:\r\ndrivers/metal/metal_objects.h:62:9: fatal error: could not build module 'QuartzCore'\r\n   62 | #import <QuartzCore/CAMetalLayer.h>\r\n      |  ~~~~~~~^\r\n24 errors generated.\r\nscons: *** [bin/obj/drivers/metal/rendering_device_driver_metal.macos.editor.arm64.o] Error 1\r\n```\r\n\r\nI have tried cleaning the cache (`git clean -fixd`), re-install the XCode, but still these kind of error emerges.\r\n* Device: MacBook M4 (macOS: 15.4)\r\n* XCode: 16.3\r\n\r\nTried build command `scons platform=macos arch=arm64` and `scons platform=macos arch=arm64 dev_build=yes`.\r\n\r\nBuilding from `4.4` branch will not have this kind of errors.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914836277/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2916627453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106820#issuecomment-2916627453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106820","id":2916627453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t2DP9","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T14:47:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T14:47:50Z","body":"Is that compilation error tied to this PR, or is it unrelated?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2916627453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918010094","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106820#issuecomment-2918010094","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106820","id":2918010094,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t7Uzu","user":{"login":"OzelotVanilla","id":59910575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTEwNTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59910575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla","html_url":"https://github.com/OzelotVanilla","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T01:57:45Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T01:57:45Z","body":"> Is that compilation error tied to this PR, or is it unrelated?\r\n\r\nI would like to say this PR does not breaks the compilation.\r\nPreviously this PR is based on branch `4.4`, and I had successfullt compiled this many times.\r\n\r\nI notice that `drivers/metal` is only generating warnings while compiling `4.4` but errors for `master`. I guess that the changing in that folder makes the compilation fail.\r\n\r\nWarning example while compiling `4.4`:\r\n```\r\ndrivers/metal/pixel_formats.mm:576:41: warning: mixture of designated and non-designated initializers in the same initializer list is a C99 extension [-Wc99-designator]\r\n  576 |         _mtl_pixel_format_descs[p_pix_fmt] = { .mtlPixelFormat = p_pix_fmt, DataFormat::DATA_FORMAT_MAX, p_fmt_caps, p_view_class, p_pix_fmt_linear, p_name };\r\n      |                                                ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\ndrivers/metal/pixel_formats.mm:576:70: note: first non-designated initializer is here\r\n  576 |         _mtl_pixel_format_descs[p_pix_fmt] = { .mtlPixelFormat = p_pix_fmt, DataFormat::DATA_FORMAT_MAX, p_fmt_caps, p_view_class, p_pix_fmt_linear, p_name };\r\n  ```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918010094/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918053890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106820#issuecomment-2918053890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106820","id":2918053890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t7fgC","user":{"login":"OzelotVanilla","id":59910575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTEwNTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59910575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla","html_url":"https://github.com/OzelotVanilla","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T02:27:23Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T04:03:40Z","body":"I found that simply delete these two lines (L42 and L43; L42 is a comment) makes the compilation success.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/de376274041cb30ad71fd3bd8f7ec674c67187d6/drivers/metal/SCsub#L43\r\n\r\nMore specificly speaking, the `-fmodules` flag causes problem.\r\n\r\nThese lines are introduced in this commit by this PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105628:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105628/commits/457299449df2a72c62b8fab4e39752f6810eb057#diff-1b97ad843ac03b1910b3b5b6888d75e1d0a5ea9a51919f28cd0b1ccb1b49fc8a\r\n\r\nIn this comment https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105628#discussion_r2090484904, they explain the reason why the line mentioned above, is added. But as they had said, this is not widely supported by all compilers, so my compiler (clang v20.1.5, from homebrew) failed to build.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918053890/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925281991","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106820#issuecomment-2925281991","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106820","id":2925281991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uXELH","user":{"login":"OzelotVanilla","id":59910575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTEwNTc1","avatar_url":"https://a